                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                      *        
*  PROGRAM    :  W4798800                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  MATCHAR KOMPLETTERAD OKS-INFO (WDQ4), SOM NÄR DETTA   *        
*                PGM GÅR ENDAST HAR RADER I STATUS R, MED FIL FRÅN     *        
*                WDQ3. DENNA FIL INNEHÅLLER ENDAST ORDERDELAR MED      *        
*                KDODELSTA = R SOM SÅLLATS UR MHA ETT INCLUDE-KORT     *        
*                I CONSTANT-MEDLEMMEN MED VILKEN MAN SORTERAR WDQ3-    *        
*                FILEN TILL EN TEMPFIL SOM SEDAN GÅR IN I PGM'ET.      *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  BOO HAMMARIN CGL                                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*  DATUM      :  MARS 92                                               *        
*                                                                      *        
*  ÄNDRING    :                                                        *        
*                                                                      *        
*     DATUM       NAMN                     AVDELNING                   *        
*     920520      STEFANO GIOBBI           30631                       *        
*     ......      ..................       ......                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*                    FILE SECTION                                *              
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*                                                                               
FILE W47988D1.               * INFIL OKS-INFO                                   
%W47998 'I98-'                                                                  
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
FILE W47988D2.               * INFIL WDQ3-RADER                                 
%WDQ301 'Q3-'                                                                   
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
FILE W47988D3 FB(83 0).  * UTFIL QKS-INFO MED TIRFS/PRODNR                      
%W47988 'U88-'                                                                  
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*                    WORKING STORAGE                             *              
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*                                                                               
W-TIBEGPAC           W    4     P 0                                             
W-DARFS              W   12     N                                               
W-DARFS-AAMMDD  W-DARFS +2   6  N                                               
                                                                                
*    -- CHECKED BY WY2000                                                       
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*                    JOB SECTION                                 *              
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (W47988D2 KEY (Q3-ODEL-IDORDER         +                              
                         Q3-ODEL-IDDC            +                              
                         Q3-ODEL-IDPRC           +                              
                         Q3-ODEL-IDLEVNR)        +                              
           W47988D1 KEY (I98-IDORDER             +                              
                         I98-IDDC                +                              
                         I98-IDPRC               +                              
                         I98-IDLEVNR    ))       +                              
                                                       NAME STEG01              
  IF MATCHED                                                                    
    PERFORM A-FYLL-W47988-POST-MATCH                                            
    PUT W47988D3                                                                
  ELSE                                                                          
    IF W47988D1                                                                 
      IF I98-IDPRC = ' '                                                        
        PERFORM B-FYLL-W47988-POST-OMATCH                                       
        PUT W47988D3                                                            
      END-IF                                                                    
    END-IF                                                                      
  END-IF                                                                        
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
A-FYLL-W47988-POST-MATCH.  PROC                                                 
                                                                                
  U88-IDDISTR           = I98-IDDISTR                                           
  U88-IDKUNDNR          = I98-IDKUNDNR                                          
  U88-IDKUNDRF          = I98-IDKUNDRF                                          
  U88-IDPRODNR          = Q3-ODEL-IDPRODNR                                      
  U88-IDARTNR           = I98-IDARTNR                                           
  U88-IDDC              = I98-IDDC                                              
  U88-KVBEART-Q         = I98-KVBEART-Q                                         
  U88-KDFRAKT           = I98-KDFRAKT                                           
  U88-KDORDKL           = I98-KDORDKL                                           
  W-DARFS               = Q3-ODEL-DARFS                                         
  U88-TIBEGPAC          = W-DARFS-AAMMDD                                        
  U88-TIREGDAT          = I98-TIREGDAT                                          
  U88-ADLAGOMR          = I98-ADLAGOMR                                          
  U88-VKART             = I98-VKART                                             
  U88-VLARTNTO          = I98-VLARTNTO                                          
  U88-PRARTNTO          = I98-PRARTNTO                                          
  U88-PRARTNTO-LOC      = I98-PRARTNTO-LOC                                      
  U88-PRARTNTO-LOCPREL  = I98-PRARTNTO-LOCPREL                                  
  U88-KDVALISO          = I98-KDVALISO                                          
  U88-IDPRC             = I98-IDPRC                                             
  U88-KDPRODSL          = I98-KDPRODSL                                          
  U88-IDLEVNR           = I98-IDLEVNR                                           
                                                                                
END-PROC.                                                                       
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
B-FYLL-W47988-POST-OMATCH.  PROC                                                
                                                                                
  U88-IDDISTR           = I98-IDDISTR                                           
  U88-IDKUNDNR          = I98-IDKUNDNR                                          
  U88-IDKUNDRF          = I98-IDKUNDRF                                          
  U88-IDPRODNR          = 0                                                     
  U88-IDARTNR           = I98-IDARTNR                                           
  U88-IDDC              = I98-IDDC                                              
  U88-KVBEART-Q         = I98-KVBEART-Q                                         
  U88-KDFRAKT           = I98-KDFRAKT                                           
  U88-KDORDKL           = I98-KDORDKL                                           
  U88-TIBEGPAC          = 0                                                     
  U88-TIREGDAT          = I98-TIREGDAT                                          
  U88-ADLAGOMR          = I98-ADLAGOMR                                          
  U88-VKART             = I98-VKART                                             
  U88-VLARTNTO          = I98-VLARTNTO                                          
  U88-PRARTNTO          = I98-PRARTNTO                                          
  U88-PRARTNTO-LOC      = I98-PRARTNTO-LOC                                      
  U88-PRARTNTO-LOCPREL  = I98-PRARTNTO-LOCPREL                                  
  U88-KDVALISO          = I98-KDVALISO                                          
  U88-IDPRC             = I98-IDPRC                                             
  U88-KDPRODSL          = I98-KDPRODSL                                          
  U88-IDLEVNR           = I98-IDLEVNR                                           
                                                                                
END-PROC.                                                                       
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
